### MUTATION PROOF (fix 2): the dispatcher option table is load-bearing
### comment_id=3777341725
2026-08-13T23:39:19Z

Oracle: a scratch git repo whose working tree holds ONE modified tracked file
and ONE untracked file, both owned by the fixture's components. The two
include-untracked spellings therefore have observably different correct
answers, so a mapping that silently binds the wrong value cannot pass.
  --include-untracked     -> ["shared/tracked.ts","shared/untracked-probe.ts"]
  --no-include-untracked  -> ["shared/tracked.ts"]
Fallback runs use a PATH with no python3* (dispatcher takes the pwsh branch).

